{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2019a.q23.material.recovered", "text": "案例： 请仔细阅读下面某高校体育专业毕业班实习生的“教学实习总结”。 教学实习总结（周杰）第2周至第3周 这一周我开始上课了，我终于成为一名老师了，记得我第一次面对30多名学生，由于初为人师的兴奋也记不得紧张。由于人数众多，喊口令声音要很大，结果一节课下来喉咙哑了，课后指导老师点评说： （1）由于（①）不当，结果是需要自己声音很大，才能使全班同学听见。 （2）话太多，教师（②）。 （3）上课的时候自己运动得太多，体育课（③）。 其他实习老师也提出了不少意见，等等。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "b04df8884b0720b2f66401316877f60a2606377f96ac284408985a7b395a785e", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3154, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3388, "next_source_question_number": 40, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 23, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "b04df8884b0720b2f66401316877f60a2606377f96ac284408985a7b395a785e"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2019a.q23"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.s1.k11", "ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.s4.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.manage", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.413.r008", "ntce.outline.413.r011", "ntce.outline.413.r030", "ntce.outline.413.r032"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2019a.q23"], "word_count": 234, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "tiyu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "b04df8884b0720b2f66401316877f60a2606377f96ac284408985a7b395a785e", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3154, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3388, "next_source_question_number": 40, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证