{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2019a.q24.material.recovered", "text": "学生情况：学生身体素质良好，对篮球非常感兴趣，部分学生已经具备一定的篮球基础，学生有一定的合作能力和团队精神。 学习内容：行进间传接球，运球急停急起，行进间投篮，原地单手肩上投篮，运球、传球、投篮组合练习，高低运球，原地双手胸前传接球。 场地器材：能满足教学需求。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "b04df8884b0720b2f66401316877f60a2606377f96ac284408985a7b395a785e", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3472, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3604, "next_source_question_number": 41, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 24, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "b04df8884b0720b2f66401316877f60a2606377f96ac284408985a7b395a785e"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2019a.q24"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.s1.k02", "ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.s1.k06", "ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.s2.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.413.r005", "ntce.outline.413.r012", "ntce.outline.413.r018", "ntce.outline.413.r020", "ntce.outline.413.r026"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2019a.q24"], "word_count": 132, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "tiyu", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "b04df8884b0720b2f66401316877f60a2606377f96ac284408985a7b395a785e", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3472, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3604, "next_source_question_number": 41, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 24, "